[
  {
    "id": "p0",
    "text": "众神最狠的刑罚，从来不是巨石，是永恒的无意义。",
    "hl": "无意义",
    "start": 0.5,
    "end": 4.6,
    "duration": 4.1,
    "file": "/Users/mlx/Desktop/IP/code-video-works/26-greek-sisyphus/audio_fish/p0_user.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "p1",
    "text": "推上山顶，滚落，再推。没有终点，也没有观众。",
    "hl": "没有观众",
    "start": 5.2,
    "end": 9.17,
    "duration": 3.97,
    "file": "/Users/mlx/Desktop/IP/code-video-works/26-greek-sisyphus/audio_fish/p1_user.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "p2",
    "text": "他为何受罚？他锁住过死神，又从冥府逃回人间。他太想活着了。",
    "hl": "太想活着",
    "start": 10.2,
    "end": 15.5,
    "duration": 5.3,
    "file": "/Users/mlx/Desktop/IP/code-video-works/26-greek-sisyphus/audio_fish/p2_user.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "p3",
    "text": "今天，石头只是换了名字：绩效清零，房贷续期，周一重启。",
    "hl": "换了名字",
    "start": 16.5,
    "end": 21.72,
    "duration": 5.22,
    "file": "/Users/mlx/Desktop/IP/code-video-works/26-greek-sisyphus/audio_fish/p3_user.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "p4",
    "text": "加缪说，他最在意的，是西西弗斯下山的那段路。",
    "hl": "下山",
    "start": 22.5,
    "end": 26.18,
    "duration": 3.68,
    "file": "/Users/mlx/Desktop/IP/code-video-works/26-greek-sisyphus/audio_fish/p4_user.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "p5",
    "text": "那是他唯一不推石头、也唯一清醒的时刻。",
    "hl": "清醒",
    "start": 27.5,
    "end": 30.11,
    "duration": 2.61,
    "file": "/Users/mlx/Desktop/IP/code-video-works/26-greek-sisyphus/audio_fish/p5_user.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "p6",
    "text": "他看清了一切：石头会滚，诸神会笑，什么都不会改变。",
    "hl": "看清",
    "start": 32.0,
    "end": 36.7,
    "duration": 4.7,
    "file": "/Users/mlx/Desktop/IP/code-video-works/26-greek-sisyphus/audio_fish/p6_user.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "p7",
    "text": "然后，他把双手重新按在石头上。不是屈服，是蔑视。",
    "hl": "蔑视",
    "start": 37.5,
    "end": 41.89,
    "duration": 4.39,
    "file": "/Users/mlx/Desktop/IP/code-video-works/26-greek-sisyphus/audio_fish/p7_user.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "p8",
    "text": "没有蔑视克服不了的命运。",
    "hl": "克服",
    "start": 43.0,
    "end": 44.78,
    "duration": 1.78,
    "file": "/Users/mlx/Desktop/IP/code-video-works/26-greek-sisyphus/audio_fish/p8_user.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "p9",
    "text": "别爱你的石头。爱那个看清一切、依然推它的自己。我是骁清Finn。你的石头，叫什么名字？",
    "hl": "你的石头",
    "start": 47.5,
    "end": 53.87,
    "duration": 6.37,
    "file": "/Users/mlx/Desktop/IP/code-video-works/26-greek-sisyphus/audio_fish/p9_user.mp3"
  }
]